5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the ground. It feels important to know what is under our feet before we start digging.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone. I am here to look at the numbers. I want to see what this place will cost us to keep running.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear. I have seen many plans come and go. I would like to see what the old work looks like now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am thinking about who will actually be here every day. The staff and the volunteers are key to this.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The paper plans are nice, but the ground is real. I need to know how people actually move through this space.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you have any specific figures in mind? I am just trying to understand the scope of the work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I am looking at the long-term ledger. The initial price is a trap if the upkeep is high.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, that is a wise thought. The people who care for it matter more than the ribbon cutting.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, yes. I am checking the current roll. It seems smaller than I expected.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the ground surprises us. I am looking at the drainage and the heat. It is not just about walking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the firms tendering. I want to know who can actually do the heavy lifting here.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the upkeep ledger. I need to see the spend per hectare for different types of ground.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the condition of the works from the earlier programme. I want to see what lasted.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll. I need to know who is left to do the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the timed counts of weekday crossings. I want to see where the people actually go.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the depot phasing notes. I want to see if we can keep the park open while working.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also look at the terms of the regional habitat fund. I need to know what they will and will not pay for.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the record of the eastern avenue planting. I want to see if the trees survived.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also look at the volunteer groups. I want to see who is already helping out.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also look at the drainage callouts. I want to see how the water behaves after storms.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
