60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are A, B, C, and D. A is woodland, B is market, C is sports, D is wetland. I am thinking about the ground.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,"A and D are heavy on plants and water. B and C are hard surfaces. The fund only pays for A and D, but the upkeep is high.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"B and C are hard surfaces. The apron failed. A and D are softer. The avenue trees died, but that was a care issue.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"A and D need water care. We have bought-in services, but the roll is small. B and C need less water, but more hard surface maintenance.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,People cross on firm ground. B and C offer that. A and D are softer. But the drainage is bad. D might help with that.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, D might help with the drainage. But the earth-moving is risky. Only two firms can do it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, the fund pays for D. But the upkeep is triple. We need to be sure we can afford it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the fund pays for A too. But A is dense trees. The avenue trees died. We need to be careful.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, the volunteers can help with A. But D needs more water management. We have bought-in services for that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, D addresses the drainage. That is a big plus. But the heat is high. We need shade.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am leaning towards D. It addresses the drainage and the fund pays for it. But I am worried about the earth-moving.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,"I am leaning towards A. The fund pays for it, and it is less hard surface than B or C. But the upkeep is high.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards A. It is softer than B or C. And the fund pays for it. But we need to ensure aftercare.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning towards A. The volunteers can help. And it is less hard surface than B or C. But we need to manage the water.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am leaning towards D. It addresses the drainage. And the fund pays for it. But the earth-moving is risky.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I will vote for D. It is the best fit for the ground and the drainage.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,"I will vote for A. It is the most sustainable financially, given the fund terms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I will vote for A. It is softer and the fund pays for it. I hope the aftercare is better this time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will vote for A. The volunteers can help, and it is manageable. I am worried about the water, but we have services.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will vote for D. It addresses the drainage and the heat. It is the most practical for the ground.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
